    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d613-a1">

                <pb facs="0600" n="526" sameAs="frus:frus1865p2/pg526"/>

                <head>[Translation.]</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1865-04-15"><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >April</hi> 15, 1865.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">My Much-esteemed Friend:</hi> I have just received
                    your welcome note of to-day, and thank you, not only for giving me the news, hut
                    because you consider that it is satisfactory to me.</p>
                <p>In effect, I have had a great pleasure in receiving it and in the result of the
                    events which it communicates; and as I cannot do otherwise than rejoice at every
                    triumph of the principles of government and of justice in all countries, I
                    congratulate you upon that which has been obtained in yours, repeating myself
                    your most affectionate friend and faithful servant, Q. B. S. M.,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>THE DUKE OF VALENCIA.</signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>Mr. <hi rendition="#small-caps">Horatio</hi> J. <hi rendition="#small-caps"
                            >Perry.</hi></p>
                </postscript>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
